<h2>❌ Payment Failed</h2>

<p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

<p>We encountered an issue processing your payment for {{businessName}}.</p>

<div class="info-box">
    <p><strong>Business:</strong> {{businessName}}</p>
    <p><strong>Amount:</strong> {{formatCurrency amount}}</p>
    <p><strong>Status:</strong> <span style="color: #ef4444;">Payment Failed</span></p>
    <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{formatDate attemptDate}}</p>
</div>

<h3>What happened?</h3>
<p
    style="background-color: #fef2f2; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; border-radius: 4px; color: #1d1d1f;">
    {{failureReason}}
</p>

<h3>Next Steps:</h3>
<ul style="color: #86868b; line-height: 1.8;">
    <li>Check that your payment method is valid and has sufficient funds</li>
    <li>Update your payment information if needed</li>
    <li>Try again or use a different payment method</li>
</ul>

<a href="{{actionUrl}}" class="button">Retry Payment</a>

<p>Your services are currently on hold until payment is completed. If you need assistance, our support team is here to
    help.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
    The StartEase Team</p>